on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <2>
  [  5] extcall 14 .............................. <soundBusy(2)>
  [  7] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 10] eq ...................................... <soundBusy(2) = 1>
  [ 11] jmpifz [ 25] ............................ if soundBusy(2) = 1 then / else
  [ 14] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 16] thebuiltin 1 ............................ <the frame>
  [ 18] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame>
  [ 20] extcall 2 ............................... go(the frame)
  [ 22] jmp [ 31]
  [ 25] pushcons 0 .............................. <"slut">
  [ 27] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"slut">
  [ 29] extcall 2 ............................... go("slut")
  [ 31] ret
end
